{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRFT a silly, whacky drifting roguelike where you control a car that should not be controlled! Bouncing from walls, maintaining control all while frantically shooting at chasing enemies! Upgrade over-the-top weapons that wreck havoc to anything in their path and go even crazier when you drift around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/77a36a6af1165d5014dec9e87168eb52.poster.avif?t=1752220977\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/77a36a6af1165d5014dec9e87168eb52.webm?t=1752220977\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/77a36a6af1165d5014dec9e87168eb52.mp4?t=1752220977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Braking is for losers!, steer left and right and use the walls to bounce around!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple two button drifting controls</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Drifting empowers you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/69e6228627851bd995a123113dc8e1fb.poster.avif?t=1752220977\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/69e6228627851bd995a123113dc8e1fb.webm?t=1752220977\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/69e6228627851bd995a123113dc8e1fb.mp4?t=1752220977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When drifting you reach the empowered<strong> <i>DRFT State</i></strong>\u00a0where your weapons go bananas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay empowered for a short duration and mow through enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get back to drifting to recharge yourself!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i> </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Criss Cross Upgrading</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades can be applied to all weapons and overlap across all of them!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep clearing waves to gain as many upgrades as possible</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 120 upgrades to collect</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/267ca52e1695eb955df83fe76af405e3.poster.avif?t=1752220977\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/267ca52e1695eb955df83fe76af405e3.webm?t=1752220977\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868240/extras/267ca52e1695eb955df83fe76af405e3.mp4?t=1752220977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 weapons, each with unique attacks and utility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ upgrades for weapons to create overpowered builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">endless waves of increasing difficulty and fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868240?t=1752220977","background_raw":"https://store.akamai